---
description: Recover and organize local browser references and leave a verified handoff in the current collection.
args:
  goal: string
returns: PersonalArtifactsReport
budget: { maxTurns: 14 }
---
Resolve the requested reference and collection work through the relevant domain lambdas. Use maintainLibrary when the goal needs bookmark or visit facts. Use arrangeCollection when the goal needs a panel change or panel facts; a failed library precondition alone does not require reading untouched panels.

Return the application disposition: changed with the actual results of domains that changed, held with native snapshot-grounded reasons when a prerequisite prevents all work, or unchanged with the relevant verified domain results. Include any held sub-operation alongside completed changes. Do not manufacture untouched domain snapshots. A different-urls hold identifies the two actual bookmarks; a tied-latest-visits hold identifies the requested reference and the actual tied URLs in its observed library basis. Follow the user's requested independent fallback work even when linking is held.
